---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI systems, prototype to production"
  description="I take AI systems from prototype to production — RAG and agents, and forecasting where the number drives a decision. PhD in machine learning."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <img
      class="avatar"
      src={SITE.avatar}
      alt={SITE.name}
      width="160"
      height="160"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <div class="hero-text">
      <h1>I take AI systems from prototype to production</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        I am Léonard Tschora. I build and ship AI systems: RAG and agent architectures,
        LLM pipelines, and forecasting models that a decision actually depends on. I
        trained on European day-ahead power markets, where a bad model loses money by
        lunchtime. I work with companies as an independent consultant, remote from
        Paris, France.
      </p>
      <p class="meta">Independent AI/ML consultant · {SITE.location} · PhD, machine learning</p>
      <div class="cta">
          <a class="button" href={SITE.booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book 30 minutes</a>{' '}
        <a class="button secondary" href="/work/">See the work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <h2>What I do</h2>
    <ul class="entries services">
      <li class="entry">
        <!-- Nodes and edges: GenAI architecture. 24x24, stroke only. See COOKBOOK §4. -->
        <svg class="icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="5" cy="12" r="2.5" />
          <circle cx="19" cy="6" r="2.5" />
          <circle cx="19" cy="18" r="2.5" />
          <path d="M7.2 11 16.6 6.9" />
          <path d="M7.2 13 16.6 17.1" />
        </svg>
        <h3>GenAI to production</h3>
        <p>
          RAG and agent architecture, evaluation harnesses, LLM pipelines, and the cost
          and latency work that turns a prototype into something which survives real
          traffic.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="entry">
        <!-- Rising series on two axes: forecasting. -->
        <svg class="icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 4v16h16" />
          <path d="M7.5 15.5 11 12l3 2.5 5.5-6" />
          <path d="M15.5 8.5h4v4" />
        </svg>
        <h3>Forecasting and time-series</h3>
        <p>
          Demand, price, load, capacity. Feature and validation design, and putting the
          model where a decision depends on the number it produces.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="entry">
        <!-- Shield with keyhole: data that stays inside the perimeter. -->
        <svg class="icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 3.2 19 6v5.2c0 4.3-2.9 7.3-7 8.8-4.1-1.5-7-4.5-7-8.8V6z" />
          <circle cx="12" cy="10.8" r="1.5" />
          <path d="M12 12.3v2.6" />
        </svg>
        <h3>Private and on-premise LLM</h3>
        <p>
          Self-hosted model deployment and private retrieval over internal data, for
          organisations whose data cannot leave their perimeter.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Three applications you can check</h2>
    <ul class="app-cards">
      <li>
        <a class="app-card" href="/work/#yeswekanji">
          <span class="app-icon app-glyph" aria-hidden="true">字</span>
          <span class="app-name">Yes we kanji</span>
          <span class="app-what">A web app for memorising Japanese kanji.</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="app-card" href="/work/#chocacao">
          <!-- Thermometer: temperature across French communes. -->
          <svg class="app-icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M14 14.8V5.5a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v9.3a4 4 0 1 0 4 0z" />
            <path d="M14 8.5h2.6" />
            <path d="M14 11.5h2.6" />
          </svg>
          <span class="app-name">ChoCacao</span>
          <span class="app-what">A web app that finds the hottest and coolest communes in metropolitan France for any hour in the week ahead.</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="app-card" href="/work/#gengiscan">
          <!-- Page under a scan line: a photo of handwriting in, Markdown out. -->
          <svg class="app-icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 8.5V4.5h4" />
            <path d="M16 4.5h4v4" />
            <path d="M20 15.5v4h-4" />
            <path d="M8 19.5H4v-4" />
            <path d="M4.5 12h15" />
            <path d="M8 8.5h8" />
            <path d="M8 15.5h8" />
          </svg>
          <span class="app-name">gengiscan</span>
          <span class="app-what">A Discord bot that turns a phone photo of a handwritten page into structured Markdown, committed straight into the user's GitHub notes repository.</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Start with a conversation</h2>
    <p>
      Thirty minutes, no deck. Tell me what you are building and what is stopping it from
      shipping, and I will tell you whether I am the right person and roughly what it
      would take. If I am not, I will say so.
    </p>
    <p class="cta">
      <a class="button" href={SITE.booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book 30 minutes</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      or email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .hero {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.75rem;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-block: 1rem 2.5rem;
    }
    .avatar {
      width: 160px;
      height: 160px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }


    .hero-text { flex: 1 1 18rem; }
    .hero h1 { margin-top: 0; }
    .hero .lead { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text); }
    .meta { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .cta { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* Service cards: the icon sits in a left column, spanning title and body. */
    .services .entry {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2em 1fr;
      column-gap: 1rem;
    }
    .services .icon {
      grid-row: span 2;
      width: 2em;
      height: 2em;
      flex: none;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-top: 0.15rem;
    }
    .services .entry h3 { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .services .entry p { margin: 0; }

    /* App cards: the whole card is the link. */
    .app-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12rem, 1fr));
      gap: 0.9rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .app-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.3rem;
      height: 100%;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .app-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .app-icon {
      width: 2em;
      height: 2em;
      flex: none;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    .app-glyph {
      font-size: 2em;
      line-height: 1;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .app-name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); }
    .app-card:hover .app-name { color: var(--accent-hover); }
    .app-what { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.45; }

    @media (max-width: 30rem) {
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
